# Invoice Register

**Monthly billing register \| consolidated client totals**

The register consolidates the quarter's client billing for the finance review; separate client invoices are prepared from the approved workstream ledger. A 10% tax provision is included for planning and must be replaced with the applicable treatment before issuing invoices.

