| Due date             || 2026-10-30 = B2 + P30D {:%Y-%m-%d}                                                                                                      | 2026-11-30 = C2 + P30D {:%Y-%m-%d}                                                                                                       | 2026-12-30 = D2 + P30D {:%Y-%m-%d}                                                                                                    |
| Billable hours       || 103.5 = sum(filter(filter(@[Sessions::F2:F121], @[Sessions::G2:G121]), filter(@[Sessions::J2:J121], @[Sessions::G2:G121]) == 9)) {:.2f} | 108.5 = sum(filter(filter(@[Sessions::F2:F121], @[Sessions::G2:G121]), filter(@[Sessions::J2:J121], @[Sessions::G2:G121]) == 10)) {:.2f} | 78 = sum(filter(filter(@[Sessions::F2:F121], @[Sessions::G2:G121]), filter(@[Sessions::J2:J121], @[Sessions::G2:G121]) == 11)) {:.2f} |
